<p>If you want a walkthrough video of a yacht, a hotel or a rental, there are two main routes. You can book a filming day with a crew, or you can have a video made with AI from the photos you already have. Both have a place. This article compares them on time, cost and what each can and cannot show, so you can pick the one that fits.</p>

<h2>What is the difference, in one sentence?</h2>
<p>A filming day records new footage on location; AI video from photos creates camera movement from existing still photos, so nothing new is recorded and nobody needs to visit.</p>

